v8: Smart word timing for subtitles (Bangla syllable + pause weights, snapped to real silences in the audio) + subtitle offset.
v9: Tab 2 = Timeline Editor (import many clips -> serial slots, CapCut-style preview/play, remove/replace/delete slot).
make_video.py (the engine) is embedded and run as-is.
